<div class="projects" id="projects">
  <ul class="bibliography list-unstyled">

    <li>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-3 abbr">
          {% assign project_preview_path = '/assets/img/projects/gait.gif' %}
          {%
            include figure.liquid
            loading="eager"
            path=project_preview_path
            sizes="200px"
            class="preview img-fluid z-depth-1 rounded"
            zoomable=true
            avoid_scaling=true
            alt="Quadrupedal Locomotion for Velocity Tracking"
          %}
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-9">
          <div class="title">Quadrupedal Locomotion for Velocity Tracking</div>

          <div class="author">Learned quadrupedal locomotion policy with gait shaped by Raibert Heuristics with PPO in IsaacLab for Unitree Go2 that tracks velocity commands under joint disturbances produced by a custom actuator friction model</div>

          <div class="periodical"><em>ROB-GY 6323 Reinforcement Learning and Optimal Control for Autonomous Systems I</em>, 2025</div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-3 abbr">
          {% assign project_preview_path = '/assets/img/projects/rsl-rl_LandingGranular-20251205-224244.gif' %}
          {%
            include figure.liquid
            loading="eager"
            path=project_preview_path
            sizes="200px"
            class="preview img-fluid z-depth-1 rounded"
            zoomable=true
            avoid_scaling=true
            alt="Omnidirectional Quadrupedal Landing Control"
          %}
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-9">
          <div class="title">Omnidirectional Quadrupedal Landing Control</div>

          <div class="author">Learned aerial reorientation policy with PPO in MuJoCo Playground that lands a quadruped (Unitree Go1) from any orientation by redistributing rotational inertia under conserved angular momentum</div>

          <div class="periodical"><em>ROB-GY 7863 Planning, Learning, and Control for Space Robotics</em>, 2025</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li>
      <div class="row">
