        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-9">
          <div class="title">SQP Solver for 2D Quadrotor Aerobatics</div>

          <div class="author">A From-scratch SQP trajectory optimizer for 2D quadrotor aerobatics, extended into a MPC that robustly executes triple-flip maneuvers under rotor disturbances</div>

          <div class="periodical"><em>ROB-GY 6323 Reinforcement Learning and Optimal Control for Autonomous Systems I</em>, 2025</div>
